@Comment:	For a number of minutes in the middle of the recording , CHI and MOT talk about Teletubbies and CHI offers descriptions of them. CHI's pronunciation of "Laa_Laa" (one of the teletubby characters) and "yellow" are strikingly similar (/"jɑjɑ/ or some variation) , and it is often difficult to determine which is the target word , especially considering that Laa_Laa is in fact yellow in color.
